      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's getting harder to ignore. lately like i can actually feel the hum of the electricity in the walls, it's like a constant vibration in my teeth. and my hearing is so sharp i can hear people whispering in the next apartment even when the TV is on. i think something in my DNA is finally starting to wake up. i need to figure out how to lean into this without the noise interfering. can u help me figure out a way to isolate and dampen my senses so i can focus on what's happening inside?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
