      "content": "the flotation tank idea is interesting, but i need something more intense than just \"relaxing.\" if my nervous system is actually remapping itself to handle these new frequencies, i feel like i need to push the deprivation further to stop the old sensory inputs from interfering with the new ones. what would an advanced, multi-day protocol look like for someone trying to force this transition to complete? like, how much isolation is actually optimal for this kind of biological acceleration?",
